### Q5: What are properties and why use them?

**Answer:**
Properties provide controlled access to fields.

```csharp
// Old way (Java-style)
public class Person
{
    private string _name;
    public string GetName() => _name;
    public void SetName(string value) => _name = value;
}

// C# way
public class Person
{
    private string _name;
    public string Name
    {
        get { return _name; }
        set { _name = value; }
    }
    
